[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3449566246","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112051#issuecomment-3449566246","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112051","id":3449566246,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NnDQm","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-27T05:20:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T14:16:01Z","body":"@kleonc Thanks for doing this 🌷\r\n\r\n@clayjohn You did not even look at the images I posted in the first post in #112037. Yet you claim it does not bring any benefit at all. Also, you claim it hurts performance, have you ever benchmarked anything? Can you seriously tell people \"Turn off Anisotropic filtering in your games because it hurts performance?\" \r\n\r\nThe fact is, Anisotropic filtering is so cheap that it does not even cost 1 frame drop at all. Even in AAA games. \r\n\r\nYou say \"we\"? since when you became we?\r\n\r\nMy game is 2D, if you look at the images I posted, it benefits greatly. Most of my textures are viewed from a distance when the Camera2D is zoomed out. My FPS is over 600FPS whether the feature is turned on or off. So it doesn't hurt the performance.\r\n\r\nWhile I can enable this in code using `RenderingServer`, it only affects the game while running, the textures still look ugly in the Editor. So merging this PR fixes the textures for me in the editor too.\r\n\r\nAnd if you don't like the filter option, don't use it. It is not like it will be set as default. It is not your Engine alone to dictate what to be added or not.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3449566246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"abuse"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3449674905","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112051#issuecomment-3449674905","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112051","id":3449674905,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NndyZ","user":{"login":"RebelliousX","id":1888186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODgxODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1888186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX","html_url":"https://github.com/RebelliousX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RebelliousX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rebellio